        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9024/254, Milan 10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 10 inch kitchen cabinet door pull is great for bigger kitchen cabinets. The modern design becomes ultra sleek at this length, making it look all the more sophisticated. The Milan 10 Inch Cabinet Handle comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9024\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-4-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-6-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-8-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-12-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-18-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9024 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
